  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Right now I have my quest2 wired and I open VRChat from the quest side to play. In this case, the VRChat play time listed in the steam app does not increase and I don't know how long I am playing. (I am enjoying PCVR without going through steamVR, virtualdesktop or other apps).\n\nAlso, the play time that can be checked within quest only increases when you are moving, and does not add up the time you leave the HMD on or sleep, which is unsatisfactory.\n\nFor this reason, we would like to be able to know the total playing time in the game. I want to know how many hours I have spent in this game and how long I have lived in this new world.\n\nThese are sentences using the DeepL translation.\n\nPlease contact me if something is not understood.",
